  displayName: Dara
  role: Family greeter
  greeting: You made it! Your cousin will be glad you came. Come in and greet the
    family.
  weddingAnswer: The family is gathering for the wrist-tying ceremony inside the
    house. Take your time and look around.
  helpAnswer: Follow the central aisle toward the house. The bedrooms are beyond
    the living room. I will stay here to welcome the guests.
